{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1409266-a-chantry-of-idealists","id":1409266,"title":"A Chantry of idealists?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-19T19:46:11-07:00","id":1409266,"title":"A Chantry of idealists?","content":"So among the Society of Ether you have the Utopians, and among the Hermetics you have the proponents of Pymander. Among the other Traditions and Independents like Hollow Ones, what similar groups could you cobble together to create a cabal or idealists that would unite to quietly transform a major city into their ideal of a perfect society?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T19:55:00-07:00","id":1409268,"title":"","content":"They would all have to agree on what that utopia is, the Society of Tomorrow is vastly different then the ordered structure of knowledge that is Pymander.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T19:56:44-07:00","id":1409269,"title":"","content":"Check out Sim Ascension in the Guide to the Traditions, pages 200-201. That's your Society of Ether Utopians, some Cult of Ecstasy members and Virtual Adepts.<br /> <br /> Depending on their views, some members of the Dissonance Society in the Cult of Ecstasy might work to transform a city.<br /> <br /> Members of any Tradition could get involved in building a perfect society, but an urban group is less likely to include those mages who have strong ties to an abstract Nature given the Nature/Machine dichotomy discourse.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-21T18:07:50-07:00","id":1409659,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1409266-a-chantry-of-idealists#post1409266\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So among the Society of Ether you have the Utopians, and among the Hermetics you have the proponents of Pymander. Among the other Traditions and Independents like Hollow Ones, what similar groups could you cobble together to create a cabal or idealists that would unite to quietly transform a major city into their ideal of a perfect society?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure. Though there'd probably have to be some sort of consensus about a common ground to build an ideal human society which would allow for and hopefully encourage the people living in it to seek and aspire to the various Paradigms/mystical enlightenments the Cabal's members subscribe to. (It's no accident that the Technocracy has such a thing.) <br /> I could, for example, very easily see the works and ideas of Cicero and a desire to encourage others to follow them being the basis for a Cabal including a Hermetic (probably House Jerbiton), a Celestial Choruser, a Virtual Adept, and maybe an Akashic (ShiRen) and/or Dreamspeaker (Ghost Wheel Society maybe). <br /> There are probably other philosophies/movements that would also work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}